# Manual/local Compose example only. NAS remote-deploy does not create or read a
# release-dir .env: it validates config/lezi-sync.env, then passes the exact
# value through the Compose process environment to avoid dotenv interpolation.
# Never commit a real value. This intentionally stays empty so copying the
# example cannot start a server with a public, guessable owner password.
# Generate a local value with: openssl rand -hex 24
LEZI_BOOTSTRAP_SECRET=
